{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33814","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 射鱼 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 射鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"注矢寂不动，澄潭晴转烘。\n下窥见鱼乐，怳若翔在空。\n惊羽决凝碧，伤鳞浮殷红。\n堪将指杯术，授与太湖公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}